// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2791441726" "This is an art and I am a master.  Let me work."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2405558159" "Don't rush the master."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P299347452" "Intricate work I'm doing.  Be quiet."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P281329793" "Shhh...I'm working here."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2503084583" "Hey, I don't see you flashing any cool moves, so be quiet."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1601925452" "I can't work and talk to you right now.  Stow it."

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P549932831" "I've fallen asleep with my eyes open."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4236290664" "Ok, if we're not inside within the next ten minutes, I'm going home."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3105559533" "I thought breakins were supposed to be fun?"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3009102352" "With all the finesse you got going on there, may as well use a sledgehammer.  Oh wait.  That IS a sledgehammer."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P658235238" "Uh, wouldn't it be faster to just break a window?"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P290860228" "Wouldn't that be easier with a lock pick?"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P712019028" "You're using a hammer on a door and you're telling ME to be quiet?"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2642400905" "I don't want to add any stress or anything, but I think I'm starting to see daylight."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1402128158" "I could have broken in to half of Fossburg by now."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P647860497" "You are taking so long.  Sheez."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P283498413" "My grandmother could get us in faster than this."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2520119427" "I don't suppose anyone cares to know that I have a key to this place."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4131186881" "You have five more minutes, then I'm going for lunch."

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3652165722" "A reprieve from the monotony!  You're going downtown!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P558172739" "I'm taking my aggressions for him out on YOU!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1511571198" "This is not 'good-bye', it's just 'I won't ever see you again'."

// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3281800337" "You're going to tell me everything I want to know.  Starting now."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3109532385" "I don't have all day.  What I DO have is a cramp and a twitchy finger."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3455306753" "You're on my last nerve."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2463496215" "You've got friends who have been messing up some deals of mine.  Care to tell me about that?"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3785374022" "We had a talk last week, you and I.  Yet here we are again."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2366521842" "You're going to learn about loss if you don't start talking."

// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1514834351" "Time to party!"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2122345352" "We got fresh meat to fry!"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3002703764" "I'll deal with you later and YOU now!"

// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P176098760" "Not talking.  Can't make me."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1938310715" "I don't know what you're talking about!"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2577372759" "I'm not talking and you can't make me."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P627970865" "You have the wrong guy."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1956090705" "Here we go again.  I didn't do it.  It wasn't me.  You got the wrong guy."
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4062716664" "You're just wasting your time here. You're not getting anything out of me."

// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1827559994" "I'm out of here!"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3391291627" "Thanks, bud!  I'm out of here!"
// SIRENSCALL_TALOSPARK_CAUGHT_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3569076016" "I'm gone!"

// SIREN_RANDALL_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3525775927" "Not gettin' past."
// SIREN_RANDALL_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2685121917" "Oh. I don't think so."
// SIREN_RANDALL_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4161771585" "Nuh uh."

// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P740059634" "We should break in to something later."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1887121260" "We should vandalize something."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4023757821" "I'm bored."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1345091002" "What's the use of being a Warrior if you're just gonna sit around all day?"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2860901993" "Want to get a burrito later?"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3265845507" "I say we take it to the Tsoo."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1599343492" "We have our orders...and then we have our ORDERS."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P850406145" "The side job gets done later tonight."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P560430168" "I'm just too tired to wreak havoc right now."

// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1306571735" "Finally!  Some action!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3489736348" "Whee!  Time to brawl!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_SITTING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1966189995" "Oh this is so on!"

// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P29332815" "So, I was thinking a break-in, either here in Buildville or down the way in Talos Park."
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P392694790" "If you have the equipment, we can set up a job for later today."
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P878722917" "No, we're going about this all wrong.  I wanna move up in the Warriors.  You gotta make your mark."
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3397475661" "So how much do you REALLY know about this side job we're working?"
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2545096565" "So I was thinking we could harass a few citizens, get some info, and bring it to the bosses for a reward."

// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2615558667" "Oh, this should be good!  Let's fight!"
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3042204414" "You heard too much!"
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2731536132" "You should have walked on by."
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P880359322" "I guess minding your own business is not a lesson you've learned yet.  Let me educate you!"

// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2873502978" "Shhh, keep it down.  You want to announce us to everyone?"
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2384306234" "Let me think about it."
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1360230085" "Hmmm...maybe."
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2568552829" "I dunno."
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P287742098" "When do you come up with these ideas?"

// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3010293142" "They heard us!  No witnesses!"
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3410911213" "I told you you were too loud!"
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2324265331" "Great!  Now we have to take care of them!"
// SIRENSCALL_BUILDVILLE_PLOT_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P446813146" "Man, that is so rude!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2649482741" "Ha ha!  About time!  I'm outta here!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2307971564" "Sweet!  I'm gone!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2163967484" "Finally!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3973812038" "She can have it back if she can catch me!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2619885121" "That lady probably has buckets of money anyway!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1729426479" "I could stop for a good fight!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P347155465" "This oughta be good!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_RUNNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2103440293" "A good fight beats the snot out of purse snatching any day!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1228196015" "Thought you'd never get it.  She had some grip!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2860529958" "Thought she was gonna take you out for a second there!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3075503384" "It was iffy for a while there!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P345434787" "You need to work out, man, she almost had you!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1135148397" "You got a wallet?"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3482064434" "I knew we shoulda worked Buildville!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2817182598" "Forget the purse!  Let's party!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_ACCOMPLICE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3143620349" "I bet this one has a wallet somewhere in that costume!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3735099144" "Why do I have to say this?  You know the drill!  Just...let...GO!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2567422945" "What's mine is mine and what's your is mine.  So just let GO!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P111487428" "Lady, why you gotta be like this?  I'm stronger!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2339598003" "I need this more than you do!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1234933531" "It's not the crown jewels!  Just give it!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P962836601" "Man, you just HAD to step in."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3933304132" "Find your own victim!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4214254831" "Now you're gonna get it!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_MUGGER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4280514088" "What?  You couldn't find your own purse to snatch?"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3758133797" "Go away!  It's mine!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2189455307" "I'm...not...letting...GO!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1068586909" "Freedom Corps!  Hero!  Help!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1244276805" "You'll never get away with this!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P778537661" "Get a job, freak!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2646714540" "It's not even your color!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2668716937" "Look, I don't have any money so you're just stealing style!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3174766368" "Serves you right!  I'm reporting this!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4129816733" "You're a hooligan!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P334778916" "Your mother would be so disappointed in you!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PURSESNATCH_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1840108695" "You'll never get away with it!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3276591246" "I'm a genius."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1062976397" "I'm Picasso!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2238770110" "I'm running out of spray paint."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3825338538" "Just a few more touches here..."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2090350220" "It's almost...done."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3334609518" "Wow, I amaze myself."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4119814553" "I'm brilliant."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_PAINTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1321717745" "Not even one art lesson, and this is a true masterpiece."

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3655031188" "Man, that's genius, that is."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1393147317" "Work...of...art."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1747294785" "Did you paint outside the lines?"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3741647885" "What is it?"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2741192101" "I don't get it."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4269816919" "Well, art IS subjective."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P609073534" "Beauty.  Beholder.  Yadda yadda yadda."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4138708412" "Well, I'm not mad on it, but it's whether or not you like it that counts."

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1774732344" "Never interrupt a master while he's crafting!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3909344727" "You-You...you interrupted him.  Why'd you have to go and do that for?  Now I gotta hurt ya."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_SPRAYPAINT_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3954382157" "I can't believe you just did that."

// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P133073007" "Yes, this is a gun.  Keep your hands in the air."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3952288506" "One move, your head becomes a convertible."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2045577782" "Ahem...did Simon say lower your arms?"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1849876930" "This thing goes off accidentally, like, all the time.  Seriously.  You'll want to keep those arms up."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3589377885" "You know the drill.  Money or your life.  All that."

// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3402669869" "Oh, that meat did NOT just interrupt me during a stick up."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P260295214" "I swear, one more wannabe steps in on my action and I'm gonna lay waste to this town!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_STICKUP_GUNTHREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1996815228" "Buzz off, get your own victim, meat!"

// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2011624472" "J-Just...take my wallet.  Whatever you need."
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4035074803" "Don't hurt me!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1237245179" "I'll do anything you ask.  Just don't shoot!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1183174982" "Don't shoot!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1961531074" "How exactly am I supposed to hand you my wallet if you won't let me lower my arms?"

// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1817894859" "Thank you, thank you!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3964459587" "Oh...my...gosh...  So out of here!"
// SIRENSCALL_ALLHOODS_GUNTHREATEN_VICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2441156605" "Arms...so achy..."

